## File 3: Loot Table (`src/rules/data/lootTables.js`)

Add to the appropriate sub-table. Common choices:

```js
// Common equipment drop
{ type: "equip", weight: 20, pool: ["my_weapon"], affixChance: 0.2, affixCountMax: 1 },

